  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p1111:b001:l013": "башаа sovereign, variant падыша/бадыша, Yudakhin and2015 https://el-sozduk.kg/башаа/",
    "manas-2010:p1111:b001:l021": "кызыталак abusive curse rendered bastards, Yudakhin талак. No literal divorced-daughter paraphrase.",
    "manas-2010:p1111:b001:l030": "Printed first-person plural ойлодук we thought retained amid singular narrative.",
